/branches{/branch}","tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/tags","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/git/blobs{/sha}","git_tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/git/tags{/sha}","git_refs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/git/refs{/sha}","trees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/git/trees{/sha}","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/statuses/{sha}","languages_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/deployments","created_at":"2017-10-05T21:56:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T01:01:53Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T05:03:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","homepage":"https://www.yugabyte.com","size":908218,"stargazers_count":9958,"watchers_count":9958,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1201,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":7608,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-13033](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-13033)\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nObserving correctness issue for below microbenchmarks when the parallel workers is picked by the planner:\r\n\r\n- Join workload:\r\n  - JOING3_3_join_on_hashpk_IN_clause_10k\r\n  - JOING3_5_join_on_rangepk_IN_clause_10k\r\n  - JOING3_4_join_on_rangepk_IN_clause_1k\r\n  - JOING3_2_join_on_hashpk_IN_clause_1k\r\n- Scan workload:\r\n  - scanG11_pkey_INclause_rangescan_increasing_rows_1000row\r\n  - scanG4_pkey_INclause_rangescan_increasing_rows_1000row\r\n  - scanG4_pkey_INclause_rangescan_increasing_rows_10000row\r\n  - scanG11_pkey_INclause_rangescan_increasing_rows_10000row\r\n\r\nAll the above workloads have query filter with IN clause having 1k or above values. The issue is also reproducible with 500 values passed in the IN clause.\r\n\r\nSharing reports to compare plans:\r\n\r\n- [Run with PG parity gflags but without parallel workers](https://perf.dev.yugabyte.com/summary_view/master-pgparity/colocated)\r\n- [Run with PG parity gflags but with parallel workers](https://perf.dev.yugabyte.com/summary_view/pgparity-parallel/colocated)\r\n\r\nManually verified same on the cluster with below steps:\r\n\r\n- Create table(pkey_rangescan_for_INclause_tbl_1) with 1M rows\r\n- Executed query with IN clause filter with 499 values `select col_bigint_1 from pkey_rangescan_for_INclause_tbl_1 where col_bigint_id_1 IN (values1,...,value499);`\r\n  - The query was executed with `Index Scan using pkey_rangescan_for_inclause_tbl_1_pkey on pkey_rangescan_for_inclause_tbl_1` (detailed plan below)\r\n- Executed analyse on table\r\n- Executed same query but this time it picked parallel workers with below plan\r\n  \r\n```\r\n Gather  (cost=1180.00..3655.05 rows=500 width=8) (actual time=4.823..794.759 rows=**519958** loops=1)\r\n   Workers Planned: 2\r\n   Workers Launched: 2\r\n   ->  Parallel Index Scan using pkey_rangescan_for_inclause_tbl_1_pkey on pkey_rangescan_for_inclause_tbl_1  (cost=180.00..2605.05 rows=208 width=8) (actual time=2.491..747.093 rows=173319 loops=3)\r\n         Index Cond: (col_bigint_id_1 = ANY ('{997248,946322,555205,96229,594293,\r\n.\r\n. ...499 values....\r\n.\r\n5928,387135,579315,937153,851165,21905,929989,225409,448619,81011,883734,863082,994578,428046,328792,286590,917248,201515}'::bigint[]))\r\n Planning Time: 2.139 ms\r\n Execution Time: 836.748 ms\r\n Peak Memory Usage: 2053 kB\r\n(8 rows)\r\n```\r\n\r\nQuery plan when executed with Index Scan\r\n```\r\nIndex Sc